---
description: Safe shared workflow for desktop and mobile agents
alwaysApply: true
---

- Treat GitHub as the shared source of truth across Codex, Claude, Cursor, and mobile work.
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md` before editing, and follow repository-specific commands.
- Work on a focused branch. Do not deploy, merge, mutate production data, or change credentials without explicit user authorization.
- Never place secrets in source, logs, chat, commits, or pull requests.
- Run applicable checks and report what actually passed.
- Production releases use the manual `Deploy Production` GitHub Actions workflow.
